# Form 008 / 009 PIS layout

## Titles

- Form 008: `SETUP Form 008 - Pre-Implementation Project Information Sheet`
- Form 009: `SETUP Form 009 - Project Information Sheet for Ongoing Projects`

## Official fields (both forms)

- Project title / code, firm and owner (name, sex, birthday), org type, business address, contacts
- Total assets (Land, Building, Equipment, Working Capital)
- Employment matrix (company hire / sub-contractor: regular, part-time, PWD, senior citizen; indirect: backward, forward, PWD, senior citizen)
- Production volume and gross sales (local / export)
- Assistance obtained from DOST checklists (`FORM_008_ASSISTANCE_OPTIONS` / `FORM_009_ASSISTANCE_OPTIONS`)

## Form 009 specifics

- Firm fields filled **only if changed** from Pre-PIS
- Prepared by PSTD/CASTD/CSTD
- Semestral filing (Jan–Jun / Jul–Dec)

## Key files

- `src/app/constants/pisFormLayout.ts`
- `src/app/components/PrePisPreview.tsx` / `PrePisEditor.tsx`
- `src/app/components/PisOngoingPreview.tsx` / `PisOngoingEditor.tsx`
- `src/app/utils/projectInformationSheet.ts`
